  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Regional Electrification Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective of this action is to contribute to a sustainable inclusive and climate-resilient socio-economic development through access to sustainable renewable energy electricity services in remote communities of Pacific Island Countries. Its Specific Objective is to increase production, distribution and use of renewable and clean energy to boost energy access, and for productive and public purposes. The Outputs will be an enhanced access to finance and developed  national energy policies, standards and regulations for off-grid renewable energy.</narrative>
  </description>
